<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source fb8354e. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A validated configuration disables one feature but also changes a setting intended for the next session. Fetch success did not establish that the whole snapshot was safe to activate now.</p>

<!-- @before 3. Live Apply Policy :: animation -->
### Activation needs an application policy

<section class="pb-figure" data-pb-flow="scene" aria-label="Apply the live value and retain the pending value">
<h3>Walkthrough 1. Apply the live value and retain the pending value</h3><p class="pb-sub">Illustrative custom LIVE/NEXT_SESSION policy, not a Firebase built-in feature. Worker behavior is a declared application contract.</p>
<div class="pb-seg" role="group" aria-label="Comparison policy"><button type="button" data-mode="scoped" aria-pressed="true">Separate active and pending</button><button type="button" data-mode="all" aria-pressed="false">Activate whole snapshot</button></div>
